post-it: Visual artifacting
cause: Overheated GPU
symptoms:
	Garbled picture
	Colours look wrong
checks:
	yes: Coloured blocks and torn lines on screen
		shows: from power-on
	yes: Scorched GPU heatsink
		shows: in the Workview
	no: Picture is clean
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the GPU, throw it in the trash
	Get a new GPU from storage
	Install the GPU
	Remount the shell
